"intricately carved mural"
"The icy mural along the northern passageway is extremely intricate, with

hundreds of tiny figures carved along most of its surface.  Apparent in the

mural is a depiction of the frozen wall, colored a frosty, opaque blue; before

the mural creatures of the plateau are represented, so well-carved they appear

life-like.  A radiant woman dominates the mural; she appears behind the frozen

wall, evidently frozen in a benevolent gesture at the plateau below.  Along

the eastern and western parts of the plateau, mountains have been chiseled

away, somehow in an even more frosty and bleak-looking light than you would

think possible to portray with just ice as a medium.

"
