Parallelling the narrowing of the smooth stairs of ice, the walls and ceiling

close in, although the staircase is still roomy enough to accommodate several

people walking side by side down the stairs.  Opaque, blue ice makes up the

stairs; they are smooth and unworn but surprisingly, offer good traction.  Far

up the stairs to the south, the top of these hundreds of stairs can be seen,

while further north the stairway descends into blackness.

