#82426
"Scene of a Gruesome Slaughter"
"Dominating this tunnel of natural rock is a gruesome collection of remains,

their flesh picked clean and in some cases skeletons even partially devoured. 

There is no logical organization to the heaps of remains; they are strewn

about at random.  A stark change from the bottom of the icy stairway just east

of here, the ice abruptly ends and a slime-coated rock cavern begins.  A line

of cryptic, worn runes has been etched all around the tunnel leading eastward,

beginning exactly where the ice ends.  The rocky, litter-strewn tunnel

continues both north and south into darkness.

"
