could accomodate an ogre with his arms at his side.  Ragged stone makes up the

walls and ceiling of this passageway, where claw and tooth have been bent

towards tearing away the bare limestone.  A thin layer of condensation covers

the jagged stone walls, along with a thin film of viscous, green-black slime. 

