echo and bounce, making this chamber feel like a great cathedral.  Massive

stalactites hang from the ceiling along the length of the cavern, some melding

with their stony twins along the ground to form great columns.  Many of the

stalagmites along the ground have been broken off, leaving only smooth lumps

where the floor has been eroded, apparently by the traffic of some great

