"Glittering Tunnel of Ice - Before Intricate Carvings"
"Dominating the tunnel is an astonishingly detailed, enormous set of carvings

along the eastern wall.  It stretches from roughly a foot below the ceiling to

the very edge of the floor, colorful dyes of some sort splashed liberally

across a frost-white surface of ice like white quartz.  The opposite wall and

the ceiling are both completely transparent, soft blue pinpoints of light

embedded within flickering gently.  Along the floor is a thick dusting of

frost, crunching underfoot like the soft, white sand of a beach.  The tunnel

turns gently here; both north and west the glittering, transparent ice

continues uninterrupted.

"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

