"White Chamber - Before a Rise in the Tunnel"
"Strangely quiet, this domed chamber is a widening of the tunnel to the west

and north.  The entire surface of the chamber is the appearance of softly

combed ice, as if a tiny trowl has been lightly dragged across every surface

of the pure ice; walls, domed ceiling, and even the soft ice of the floor.

