#82482
"Mist-filled Alcove of Ice"
"A languid white mist clings to the ground, dodging away from your movements

like a lazy serpent.  Through breaks in the mist, a jagged surface of cracked

ice forms a slanted ledge twenty feet square.  In all directions but south, a

vertical wall of sheer ice rises out of sight into the blackness above.  A

rushing jet of water can barely made out through what must be the source of

the mist to the south - one with the ability to fly could move through the

open cave to the south, though others would be stranded on this inhospitable

ledge.

"
"[Nereus] entering this room causes mage to go invis

[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

