is a glimmering, transparent window of ice, a gleaming tunnel of white ice

beyond.  Fine mist floats through the air, diffusing the light and giving the

white tunnel to the west a warm, magical glow.  Below, an echoing blackness

yawns, the shaft falling for what could be forever.

