"Horrible Unlife"
"Dark limestone is only barely visible through small patches along the walls

and ceiling of this terrible, living chamber.  Sickly, pink-white flesh covers

segments of the walls and grows along the ceiling, pulsating and quivering

gently as if alive.  The floor of this cavernous passageway has been littered

with all manner of debris - discarded shields, old swords, belt buckles, bone

buttons - anything resistant to the decay-promoting damp of the cavern.  While

a collapse in the ceiling just west of here occurred sometime in the past, a

large boulder has been rolled away and would allow the average ogre to squeeze

into whatever tunnel lies beyond.

