"groupings symbols glimmer"
"Groupings of three, six, and nine symbols are clustered on the walls and

ceiling, quartz-colored etchings indented slightly below the level of the

obsidian.  The runes glimmer softly, pulsating off and on with a dim light in

reaction to some unknowable input.

"
E
"obelisk-like pillars rectangles square"
"On each side of the room, there are eight to ten square pillars which vary in

height between a foot and five feet tall, with various charms and other

treasures placed on top of them.  Some of the pillars are empty - what might

have been on top of them or whether they were always empty is a mystery.  All

of the pillars are made of the same black obsidian as the walls and ceiling of

the room and are covered in the same groupings of quartz-colored indentations.

"
