#82617
"Before a Marble Bier - End of the Obsidian Tomb"
"A massive room for a mausoleum, this room is twelve foot in each direction and

perfectly square.  The walls are stone, gleaming obsidian, dustless and cold.

All six surfaces of the chamber are mirror-smooth.  Irridescent reflections

dance with the movement of light through the tomb.  Unlike the chamber through

the doorway to the west, which is ornately tooled and runed, no magical wards

are evident here - the one laid in this room must have trusted in some other

means to keep the chamber intact for so long.

"
"[Nereus] DO NOT move acode 2 in this room!

[Nereus] Acode 3 in this room summons the armor after they have appeared.  DO NOT MOVE


[Nereus] Reset0 - used for entering

[Nereus] Reset1 - used to warn for attacking.

[Nereus] Reset2 = false after liche has screamed to call for help


[Nereus] Counter_object value0 is used for the liche getting sick of players talking

[Nereus] Counter_object value1 is used for the liche tearing off his fingers (only 1)

[Nereus] Counter_object value2 is used for the outline self junking


[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

"
