"A Womb of Stone"
"A spherical, gray chamber of limestone, walls so smooth they shine in the

light as if buffed carefully with a soft cloth.  Various unidentifiable items

litter the entire room, except for a neat circle wide enough for a man to sit

cross-legged.  In the ceiling above, a hole roughly three feet across has been

dug into the limestone above, glimpses of an obsidian chamber visible up

through the hole.

"
"[Nereus] ** Room Finished **

