"unidentifiable items"
"Various strange items litter the chamber, except for a small area in the

center of the chamber that remains clear.  Among the pieces in the room are

perfectly round spheres, smooth as polished marble and heavier than steel; an

orb with a living flame contained inside it; various books whose covers cannot

be opened; and several metal objects who seem to be in impossible shapes, like

an optical illusion brought to life.  Although the items are strange, many of

them seem to actually be fused to the limestone walls, while others, like the

books, cannot be opened.  Apparently the liche trusted to various magical

means to prevent his treasures from being tampered with.

